# Dataset symlinks into /mnt/data/sources are per-machine; the directory itself
# is tracked via its .gitkeep. `data/*` (not `/data`) so git descends far enough
# for the negation below to be reachable.
data/*
!data/.gitkeep
!data/README.md
CLAUDE.local.md
